      "planPath": "frontend/src/audio/speech/banks/alfie/manifest.json",
      "text": "When two pieces share a line, an attack on the first can reach the second. The other side now has a skewer: if the queen in front gives way, the piece behind it could come under attack. Shared lines like that are worth checking before each move.",
